WEBVTT

00:09.380 --> 00:11.380
<b>Let's go to the beach sometime.</b>

00:12.680 --> 00:13.490
<b>The sound of</b>

00:14.240 --> 00:16.780
<b>waves makes me feel a bit tingly.</b>

00:21.070 --> 00:22.600
<b>We should get going.</b>

00:22.600 --> 00:23.320
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:54.130 --> 01:58.930
<b>Episode 7
 "Bicycle"</b>

01:59.380 --> 02:00.140
<b>Morning.</b>

02:01.230 --> 02:02.410
<b>I'm coming in.</b>

02:03.530 --> 02:04.290
<b>Oh.</b>

02:06.260 --> 02:07.300
<b>Sleeping outside?</b>

02:14.720 --> 02:17.590
<i>You've liked girls before, too, haven't you?</i>

02:18.270 --> 02:19.830
<b>I never thought of it as anything</b>

02:20.540 --> 02:22.300
<b>more than a weird feeling.</b>

02:22.800 --> 02:24.330
<b>I surprised myself.</b>

02:25.000 --> 02:28.010
<i>I'm surprised you'd like such a simple girl.</i>

02:28.540 --> 02:29.890
<b>Don't look down on me.</b>

02:30.240 --> 02:31.510
<i>I wouldn't.</i>

02:34.340 --> 02:36.260
<i>Hopefully you won't need us anymore.</i>

02:38.070 --> 02:41.040
<b>I don't hate you guys.</b>

02:55.440 --> 02:57.250
All I can hear

02:58.150 --> 02:59.740
is your voice.

03:00.670 --> 03:04.540
I keep seeing you, too.

03:05.160 --> 03:08.140
<b>Touko, Yana-chan is here.</b>

03:08.140 --> 03:09.540
<b>Yana-chan?</b>

03:09.800 --> 03:11.980
<b>Yeah? So what's the event?</b>

03:11.980 --> 03:13.450
<b>Fifty-meter freestyle.</b>

03:13.450 --> 03:15.870
<b>I just hit 32 seconds the other day.</b>

03:17.270 --> 03:20.010
<b>My goal is 31 seconds flat.</b>

03:20.010 --> 03:22.170
<b>You're really going for it, Hina-chan!</b>

03:22.170 --> 03:24.000
<b>You're working toward your</b>

03:24.000 --> 03:26.290
<b>dream job as a model, too, right?</b>

03:26.290 --> 03:28.890
<b>I've secretly been rooting for you.</b>

03:29.230 --> 03:31.450
<b>You sure do have a nice body.</b>

03:31.450 --> 03:32.980
<b>I'm jealous.</b>

03:33.580 --> 03:34.860
<b>Thanks.</b>

03:34.860 --> 03:37.130
<b>Let's go shopping for clothes sometime.</b>

03:37.130 --> 03:38.230
<b>I'll help you choose.</b>

03:38.230 --> 03:41.210
<b>Really? You would? Yes, please!</b>

03:41.560 --> 03:42.320
<b>Touko.</b>

03:43.060 --> 03:44.820
<b>Sorry for just showing up.</b>

03:47.140 --> 03:48.450
<b>Let's talk outside.</b>

03:51.270 --> 03:52.890
<b>See you soon, Hina-chan.</b>

03:52.890 --> 03:53.960
<b>Okay.</b>

03:55.480 --> 03:56.960
<b>About Yuki-kun the other day...</b>

04:03.880 --> 04:05.750
<b>That slap of yours...</b>

04:07.610 --> 04:11.300
<b>It's okay. I didn't like 
what Kakeru-kun did either.</b>

04:11.990 --> 04:13.570
<b>Kakeru-kun, huh?</b>

04:13.870 --> 04:14.980
<b>What?</b>

04:14.980 --> 04:18.050
<b>Whatever. You make yourself so obvious.</b>

04:18.450 --> 04:20.840
<b>I do?</b>

04:20.840 --> 04:21.590
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:23.650 --> 04:26.100
<b>Yuki's so stupid.</b>

04:27.120 --> 04:30.370
<b>Can't he tell he doesn't stand a chance?</b>

04:31.650 --> 04:33.710
<b>Did you hear Sachi is staying 
at the hospital today?</b>

04:33.710 --> 04:36.210
<b>Yeah, for tests.</b>

04:36.490 --> 04:39.530
<b>Nothing to worry about then, I guess.</b>

04:39.860 --> 04:43.520
<b>We should hold back on the visits, 
so we don't get in the way.</b>

04:43.820 --> 04:44.640
<b>Yeah,</b>

04:44.640 --> 04:47.970
<b>let's not get in the way 
of their secret dates.</b>

05:00.060 --> 05:03.170
<b>Sacchan's fine. It looks 
like she's doing well.</b>

05:03.170 --> 05:03.730
<b>Huh?</b>

05:04.380 --> 05:07.390
<b>Oh, no, I think she'd be happy if we visited.</b>

05:32.960 --> 05:35.460
<b>Yeah, it's me.</b>

05:36.430 --> 05:37.220
<b>Sure.</b>

05:38.150 --> 05:39.640
<b>See you later.</b>

05:49.300 --> 05:52.050
<b>Everyone's so scattered lately.</b>

05:52.050 --> 05:55.850
<b>It's been a bit weird, ever
 since that David showed up.</b>

05:55.850 --> 05:57.040
<b>Ready.</b>

06:00.590 --> 06:02.000
<b>Here's your cola.</b>

06:02.580 --> 06:05.530
<b>Visiting hours at the hospital</b>

06:05.530 --> 06:07.220
<b>end so early.</b>

06:07.670 --> 06:10.800
<b>I wish they'd let us stay till 10 PM at least.</b>

06:16.200 --> 06:18.270
<b>Your pianist hands are so strong.</b>

06:18.570 --> 06:20.160
<b>Here comes a crescendo!</b>

06:20.160 --> 06:21.040
<b>Ow, ow, ow!</b>

06:21.040 --> 06:22.390
<b>Fortissimo!</b>

06:22.390 --> 06:23.770
<b>Ow!</b>

06:29.740 --> 06:31.710
<b>I'll be going now, too.</b>

06:31.710 --> 06:33.760
<b>Call me if there's anything you need.</b>

06:34.060 --> 06:34.690
<b>Okay.</b>

06:34.690 --> 06:35.460
<b>Oh?</b>

06:35.460 --> 06:36.450
<b>Come in.</b>

06:37.820 --> 06:38.630
<b>Oh...</b>

06:39.430 --> 06:40.500
<b>Your friend?</b>

06:41.000 --> 06:42.500
<b>My boyfriend, Hiro-kun.</b>

06:42.500 --> 06:43.900
<b>Oh?</b>

06:44.350 --> 06:45.670
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

06:45.670 --> 06:47.530
<b>I'm Sachi's mother.</b>

06:48.720 --> 06:50.980
<b>I'm Sacchan's b-b-boyfriend,</b>

06:50.980 --> 06:52.890
<b>Hiro Shirosaki.</b>

06:53.160 --> 06:55.260
<b>My grandpa made these cookies.</b>

06:56.500 --> 06:57.590
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:09.670 --> 07:10.380
<b>Hey.</b>

07:21.290 --> 07:25.290
<b>I didn't know there was 
a swallow's nest here.</b>

07:25.890 --> 07:27.500
<b>Hey, hatchlings.</b>

07:28.600 --> 07:29.720
<b>Looks like it.</b>

07:30.170 --> 07:31.510
<b>I know there are at least two.</b>

07:38.450 --> 07:41.600
<b>You know, I've lived here all this time,</b>

07:41.600 --> 07:44.490
<b>but you seem to know so 
much more about this place.</b>

07:44.490 --> 07:46.050
<b>That makes me a little unhappy.</b>

07:46.630 --> 07:49.070
<b>Knowing a few small things about this city</b>

07:49.550 --> 07:53.360
<b>doesn't compare to you having lived here.</b>

07:53.360 --> 07:55.540
<b>Huh? That's not true.</b>

07:55.540 --> 07:57.130
<b>You're amazing, Kakeru-kun.</b>

07:57.940 --> 08:01.070
<b>I made a fool of myself.</b>

08:02.260 --> 08:03.610
<b>That's not true.</b>

08:07.550 --> 08:09.800
<b>Yana-chan came over today.</b>

08:09.800 --> 08:11.550
<b>We talked about yesterday.</b>

08:12.840 --> 08:14.050
<b>You certainly are friends.</b>

08:16.860 --> 08:19.750
<b>Um, what are we,</b>

08:19.750 --> 08:20.930
<b>you and I?</b>

08:27.450 --> 08:28.320
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:29.260 --> 08:31.410
<b>Now I can't look at you.</b>

08:32.110 --> 08:34.610
<b>Have we become more than</b>

08:34.610 --> 08:37.410
<b>just two people who share a weird ability?</b>

08:44.290 --> 08:45.510
<b>Look out!</b>

08:46.600 --> 08:49.460
<b>I saw you falling.</b>

08:49.720 --> 08:51.840
<b>You'll be okay as long as 
we stay like this, right?</b>

08:53.060 --> 08:54.720
<b>The future can't be changed.</b>

08:55.070 --> 08:56.710
<b>Let's go to the beach.</b>

08:56.710 --> 08:58.120
<b>It's safer.</b>

08:58.120 --> 09:00.100
<b>The beach tomorrow. For sure.</b>

09:12.130 --> 09:13.350
<b>What are you looking at?</b>

09:13.350 --> 09:15.400
<b>Here he comes.</b>

09:17.390 --> 09:17.990
<b>Oh?</b>

09:18.240 --> 09:19.900
<b>There he is, right on time.</b>

09:19.900 --> 09:21.990
<b>He's coming, the 5:30 guy.</b>

09:21.990 --> 09:23.370
<b>He's so amazing.</b>

09:23.720 --> 09:26.180
<b>That's my sister's friend.</b>

09:26.910 --> 09:28.120
<b>Really?</b>

09:28.120 --> 09:30.330
<b>You know him? Have you talked to him?</b>

09:30.330 --> 09:31.180
<b>I haven't.</b>

09:31.180 --> 09:32.540
<b>Really? That's a shame.</b>

09:32.540 --> 09:34.300
<b>He's just so hot.</b>

09:34.300 --> 09:35.230
<b>I know.</b>

09:35.430 --> 09:38.320
<b>But I heard he's kind of in a mess.</b>

09:38.780 --> 09:40.300
<b>What's wrong?</b>

10:05.550 --> 10:06.530
<b>Hey there.</b>

10:08.500 --> 10:09.080
<b>Coach.</b>

10:09.680 --> 10:12.340
<b>You've been training, huh?</b>

10:12.640 --> 10:15.800
<b>Your record at the track 
meet—I'm impressed.</b>

10:16.460 --> 10:17.760
<b>It was so bad.</b>

10:18.020 --> 10:19.430
<b>No, it wasn't.</b>

10:19.720 --> 10:22.010
<b>Call me if you want to talk about anything.</b>

10:22.320 --> 10:25.410
<b>Oh, I have summer camp for a week 
starting the day after tomorrow.</b>

10:25.410 --> 10:27.560
<b>I'd prefer if you could call 
me before or after that.</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:03.510
<b>Working hard first thing in 
the morning, huh, Onee-san?</b>

11:03.810 --> 11:06.580
<b>You're keeping up well 
with your club work, too.</b>

11:07.470 --> 11:08.520
<b>Hey.</b>

11:10.060 --> 11:11.880
<b>I saw Yukinari-san yesterday.</b>

11:11.880 --> 11:15.270
<b>From our pool we can
see him on his routine run.</b>

11:15.270 --> 11:18.090
<b>I don't really get it,</b>

11:18.090 --> 11:20.430
<b>but he's kind of our club's idol.</b>

11:20.430 --> 11:22.630
<b>They're talking about making 
a fan club and stuff.</b>

11:22.630 --> 11:25.150
<b>Wow! That's Yuki-kun.</b>

11:25.150 --> 11:26.660
<b>Small world, huh?</b>

11:27.490 --> 11:29.170
<b>Yuki-kun's hot.</b>

11:29.470 --> 11:31.040
<b>I'm not surprised.</b>

11:31.040 --> 11:34.020
<b>True, he looked good running.</b>

11:35.390 --> 11:38.140
<b>Yeah, Yuki-kun is good-looking.</b>

11:39.210 --> 11:41.510
<b>Onee-chan, did something happen?</b>

11:43.190 --> 11:45.470
<b>Why? Nothing.</b>

11:45.770 --> 11:48.850
<b>You're such a bad liar.</b>

11:50.160 --> 11:53.020
<b>Um... I'm going to go visit Sacchan.</b>

11:53.660 --> 11:55.180
<b>I have to go, too.</b>

12:04.430 --> 12:06.960
<b>My tests are starting soon.</b>

12:07.520 --> 12:09.120
<b>Oh, really?</b>

12:09.120 --> 12:11.570
<b>I'll get going, then.</b>

12:11.570 --> 12:13.240
<b>Thanks for coming every day.</b>

12:13.240 --> 12:13.790
<b>Sure.</b>

12:14.330 --> 12:15.000
<b>Bye.</b>

12:24.430 --> 12:25.430
<b>Nee-chan.</b>

12:34.620 --> 12:35.230
<b>Yes?</b>

12:35.850 --> 12:37.230
<b>I'm coming in.</b>

12:37.630 --> 12:38.670
<b>Welcome.</b>

12:38.670 --> 12:40.530
<b>How are you? Doing okay?</b>

12:41.180 --> 12:42.940
<b>Yeah, I'm fine.</b>

12:46.230 --> 12:47.870
<b>Oh, that's—</b>

12:47.870 --> 12:50.020
<b>Wait, let me guess.</b>

12:52.010 --> 12:53.730
<b>A gift from Hiro-kun.</b>

12:54.020 --> 12:54.710
<b>Right?</b>

12:55.360 --> 12:56.330
<b>Right.</b>

12:57.390 --> 12:58.340
<b>Kakeru-kun?</b>

12:58.340 --> 13:00.940
<b>Oh, um, Okikura-kun.</b>

13:00.940 --> 13:01.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:02.760 --> 13:05.010
<b>So Kakeru-kun</b>

13:05.010 --> 13:06.910
<b>said something a bit nasty.</b>

13:06.910 --> 13:08.800
<b>Yana-chan heard him, and...</b>

13:13.170 --> 13:14.040
<b>When?</b>

13:14.040 --> 13:15.450
<b>Tomorrow afternoon.</b>

13:15.450 --> 13:18.300
<b>Ah. I heard the weather 
will be nice tomorrow, too.</b>

13:18.860 --> 13:21.650
<b>I thought maybe if we went to 
the beach together tomorrow...</b>

13:21.840 --> 13:22.780
<b>What?</b>

13:23.540 --> 13:24.270
<b>Yeah,</b>

13:24.570 --> 13:27.610
<b>I thought maybe I might see something new.</b>

13:28.120 --> 13:31.040
<b>"Something"? Those sparkly things?</b>

13:31.040 --> 13:33.860
<b>I think being with Kakeru-kun,</b>

13:33.860 --> 13:36.000
<b>I'm starting to understand what those are.</b>

13:36.460 --> 13:39.500
<b>I'll let you know when I have a better idea.</b>

13:39.920 --> 13:40.600
<b>Okay.</b>

14:01.480 --> 14:02.510
<b>What?</b>

14:02.510 --> 14:03.740
<b>Where're you going?</b>

14:03.740 --> 14:04.870
<b>The coach is coming.</b>

14:04.870 --> 14:05.530
<b>Hina.</b>

14:16.250 --> 14:17.220
<b>Hi again.</b>

14:17.520 --> 14:20.380
<b>I'm Touko Fukami's sister, Hina Fukami.</b>

14:20.810 --> 14:22.750
<b>Hey, um...</b>

14:23.020 --> 14:25.260
<b>please stay attractive.</b>

14:25.590 --> 14:28.630
<b>Please stay attractive.</b>

14:59.100 --> 15:00.640
<i>Is it not the future?</i>

15:24.040 --> 15:26.530
<b>What's wrong, Sacchan? It's so late.</b>

15:26.830 --> 15:27.780
<i>I want to go to the beach.</i>

15:29.070 --> 15:30.830
<i>I'm being discharged tomorrow.</i>

15:31.120 --> 15:32.790
<i>Let's all go in the afternoon.</i>

15:32.790 --> 15:35.430
<i>I want to see Yukinari-kun 
and Yanagi-chan, too.</i>

15:35.430 --> 15:37.240
<i>And I want to light fireworks at night.</i>

15:37.480 --> 15:39.210
<i>Okay. Sounds good.</i>

15:39.510 --> 15:42.940
<b>I know it's short notice, 
but I'll let Touko-chan know.</b>

15:42.940 --> 15:43.900
<i>Got it.</i>

15:43.900 --> 15:46.690
<i>I'll tell Yanagi-san and Yukinari.</i>

16:04.120 --> 16:05.150
<b>What'll you have?</b>

16:06.540 --> 16:08.280
<b>You never replied to my message 
about going to the beach.</b>

16:08.280 --> 16:10.310
<b>You can make it, right?</b>

16:10.310 --> 16:12.180
<b>Yanagi-san said she can come.</b>

16:13.680 --> 16:14.110
<b>Ah.</b>

16:14.530 --> 16:15.730
<b>Don't "ah" me!</b>

16:15.730 --> 16:16.700
<b>Are you okay?</b>

16:16.700 --> 16:18.370
<b>What the heck, man?</b>

16:23.880 --> 16:27.290
<b>He's going to the beach with his 
girlfriend today, right? How nice...</b>

16:27.620 --> 16:29.840
<b>He's grown up to be a weird kid.</b>

16:29.840 --> 16:33.610
<b>Oh? I think he's a charming young man.</b>

16:33.610 --> 16:36.140
<b>That doesn't sound like 
something a mother would say.</b>

16:36.880 --> 16:38.850
<b>So, about that thing—</b>

16:41.310 --> 16:43.830
<b>The tests got delayed.</b>

16:43.830 --> 16:45.840
<b>She's staying until tomorrow.</b>

16:45.840 --> 16:47.200
<b>Is that so?</b>

16:47.200 --> 16:50.480
<b>Sachi, I'm positive I told you yesterday.</b>

16:50.810 --> 16:51.930
<b>Is that right?</b>

16:51.930 --> 16:53.150
<b>Goodness.</b>

16:53.540 --> 16:56.060
<b>You're causing trouble for Mr. Boyfriend, too.</b>

16:56.060 --> 16:58.310
<b>No, what trouble?</b>

16:58.920 --> 17:00.680
<b>You said "Mr. Boyfriend"?</b>

17:02.310 --> 17:04.160
<b>Okay, I understand.</b>

17:04.790 --> 17:05.590
<b>Bye.</b>

17:07.750 --> 17:09.880
<b>Well, I'm going home now.</b>

17:10.080 --> 17:10.790
<b>Okay.</b>

17:10.790 --> 17:11.910
<b>Sorry.</b>

17:11.910 --> 17:14.010
<b>Take care of Sachi, please.</b>

17:14.010 --> 17:14.790
<b>Right!</b>

17:19.380 --> 17:22.740
<b>I should text everyone to let 
them know we're canceling.</b>

17:23.290 --> 17:25.380
<b>I hate David.</b>

17:26.330 --> 17:28.230
<b>You do? Why?</b>

17:28.590 --> 17:31.730
<b>Everyone gets split up when he's here.</b>

17:32.270 --> 17:36.260
<b>True, everyone's kind of scattered lately.</b>

17:36.830 --> 17:40.240
<b>Oh, so should we move the beach to tomorrow?</b>

17:40.820 --> 17:44.460
<b>Touko-chan has a date at 
Hinode Beach with David.</b>

17:45.580 --> 17:48.970
<b>So I never contacted Touko-chan.</b>

17:49.510 --> 17:50.300
<b>Oh.</b>

17:50.750 --> 17:53.700
<b>But wouldn't that mean</b>

17:53.700 --> 17:56.250
<b>you tried to get everyone to ruin</b>

17:56.250 --> 17:58.480
<b>David's date with Touko, 
just because you hate him?</b>

17:59.200 --> 17:59.960
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:00.360 --> 18:01.370
<b>It would.</b>

18:01.760 --> 18:05.760
<b>So you called me to get me to do that?</b>

18:08.920 --> 18:11.110
<b>Sacchan, that's so...</b>

18:16.740 --> 18:19.030
<b>I'm going home for today.</b>

18:24.810 --> 18:26.020
<b>Over here!</b>

18:34.300 --> 18:35.310
<b>Hiro.</b>

18:35.770 --> 18:37.260
<b>I'll give you a ride.</b>

18:38.750 --> 18:39.620
<b>Sure.</b>

18:42.470 --> 18:44.220
<b>Sorry, can't make it today.</b>

18:59.580 --> 19:00.640
<b>Oh.</b>

19:00.640 --> 19:02.290
<b>Okay, I'll pass it on.</b>

19:03.200 --> 19:05.230
<b>We're not doing the beach trip today.</b>

19:07.690 --> 19:08.700
<b>Did you hear me?</b>

19:08.700 --> 19:10.250
<b>We're not doing the beach trip today.</b>

19:17.440 --> 19:18.470
<b>Did you wait long?</b>

19:18.730 --> 19:21.260
<b>I don't mind waiting.</b>

19:21.260 --> 19:23.180
<b>So you did wait.</b>

19:23.790 --> 19:24.940
<b>Is it tingly?</b>

19:24.940 --> 19:25.350
<b>What?</b>

19:26.070 --> 19:27.140
<b>The sound of the waves.</b>

19:27.760 --> 19:29.990
<b>It feels a bit different from before.</b>

19:30.580 --> 19:33.310
<b>I don't know that I've ever 
come at this time of day.</b>

19:34.010 --> 19:35.610
<b>This is for you.</b>

19:36.150 --> 19:37.090
<b>Glass beads.</b>

19:37.390 --> 19:38.370
<b>They match.</b>

19:38.370 --> 19:39.380
<b>Thanks.</b>

19:41.370 --> 19:43.870
<b>There's something that's been bothering me.</b>

19:45.850 --> 19:48.350
<b>You said I would fall.</b>

19:48.350 --> 19:51.570
<b>I did. Don't ever go anywhere high!</b>

19:52.180 --> 19:55.130
<b>Do you really think that's possible?</b>

19:56.150 --> 19:57.340
<b>To put it bluntly,</b>

19:57.740 --> 19:59.120
<b>I can never</b>

19:59.420 --> 20:02.160
<b>go anywhere I might fall from.</b>

20:03.140 --> 20:04.730
<b>That's impossible.</b>

20:05.460 --> 20:07.270
<b>Then what can we do?</b>

20:08.270 --> 20:10.430
<b>Are they really fragments of the future?</b>

20:10.430 --> 20:11.350
<b>But—</b>

20:11.350 --> 20:14.650
<b>But you're the one that told me so.</b>

20:15.140 --> 20:17.140
<b>We should think it over a bit more carefully.</b>

20:17.140 --> 20:18.960
<b>I'm going to go buy juice!</b>

20:19.640 --> 20:21.030
<b>Kakeru-kun, what would you like?</b>

20:21.450 --> 20:22.710
<b>I'll have water.</b>

20:22.710 --> 20:26.540
<b>As a kid, I used to wonder why grown-ups pay</b>

20:26.540 --> 20:30.540
<b>money to buy water and tea 
from vending machines.</b>

20:30.540 --> 20:32.670
<b>There's Halpis Water right next to it.</b>

20:47.850 --> 20:51.100
<b>Oh, so you were invited, too.</b>

20:51.850 --> 20:53.310
<b>Isn't Touko with you?</b>

20:53.720 --> 20:55.810
<b>She went to get something to drink.</b>

20:56.070 --> 20:59.690
<b>Oh. Now's a good time to tell you, then.</b>

21:01.240 --> 21:03.650
<b>It's your fault Yuki 
isn't attractive anymore.</b>

21:10.120 --> 21:11.540
<b>Sorry to interrupt.</b>

21:11.870 --> 21:12.830
<b>I'll be going.</b>

21:14.310 --> 21:14.960
<b>Hey.</b>

21:17.510 --> 21:18.880
You're a cute couple.

21:21.460 --> 21:22.920
<b>No!</b>

21:23.840 --> 21:24.700
<b>No!</b>

21:25.130 --> 21:25.720
<b>Touko!</b>

21:29.730 --> 21:30.220
<b>No!</b>

21:31.190 --> 21:31.970
<b>No!</b>

23:30.830 --> 23:32.900
<b>I'm going to get a proper explanation.</b>

23:32.900 --> 23:34.300
<b>I think I won't ask.</b>

23:34.300 --> 23:36.800
<b>Touko, what's wrong? What did you see?</b>

23:36.800 --> 23:39.470
<b>I think I want to visit Jonathan.</b>

23:37.020 --> 23:40.060
<b>Episode 8
"Snow"</b>
